# Aura Voice CX - Frontend Environment Configuration
# When deploying the frontend separately on Vercel, set VITE_API_BASE_URL to your backend Vercel deployment URL.
# Example: VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://aura-skincare-backend.vercel.app
# Leave blank for local development to use the built-in Vite dev proxy (localhost:3000).

